      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_15",
      "quote": "Though few studies on this topic exist, the available evidence suggests a high prevalence amongst refugees in LMIC, with wide variation between and within countries. ... The available literature is scarce and of low quality, and further detailed studies are needed to further characterize the prevalence and risk factors for HBV amongst refugees in LMIC",
