      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_15",
      "quote": "This topic is of public health relevance as LMIC have the highest burden of hepatitis B, and host the most refugees, but also face health system challenges and constrained resources.",
