      "reason": "The need for the current review is explained relative to prior reviews (Rossi et al. and refugee children review), which are identified and cited, but this appears in the Discussion rather than the Introduction rationale."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e4",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
